{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（18日）上午10時29分，警方接報一輛私家車在飛鵝山扎山道翻側跌落山坡。據報車上3人已爬出車外等候協助。救援人員到場，其中一名男乘客手部受傷，救護員正為他包紮；警方正調查事故成因。</p><figure><img alt=\"傷者登上救護車送院。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260718/1155110054605754368472095.jpeg/x3hV9Qs_yFLjBQ5HoOv0RqhdWbNFX7c2aWR54kxkeeI\"/><figcaption>傷者登上救護車送院。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260718/1155110051594113024683129.jpeg/RNOB7Rtx6y2HnHQDDUOVXSpf1fVrtKAPrBaPvokWj74\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防車前往札山道交通意外現場。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260718/1155105230182944768491362.jpeg/pGeTQTG8YPcTnjjveDYmcxtZW4VUZyDXIshRZCLIUWQ\"/><figcaption>消防車前往札山道交通意外現場。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-18T03:38:00.190973+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}